#: ../../tools/flymine_tools.rst:72 6abd865e9ef54347b4cd7c8c1e538e5b
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search FlyMine specifically for Drosophila genes. This "
"is a convenience wrapper that filters results to the Gene category only. "
"Returns gene symbols, FlyBase gene IDs (FBgn numbers), secondary "
"identifiers (CG numbers), and organism information. FlyMine covers 12+ "
"Drosophila species plus other model organisms. For broader searches "
"across all entity types, use FlyMine\\_search instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/flymine_tools.rst:76 6ec78d4edd4248c39b24a841d4439d10
msgid ""
"``q`` (string) (required) Gene search query: gene symbol (e.g., 'dpp', "
"'Notch', 'wg', 'hh'), FlyBase ID (e.g., 'FBgn0000490'), or keyword."
msgstr ""

